			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Remove deprecated Electron polyfill shims\n\nDelete the obsolete Electron-specific polyfill files from Source/Polyfills and Target/Polyfills directories. These shims (ChildProcessPolyfill, FileProtocolShim, FileSystemPolyfill, IPCRendererShim, NativeModulePolyfill, ProcessPolyfill, SharedProcessProxy) were used for the Electron-based VS Code substrate.\n\nAs Land transitions from Electron to Tauri/Rust, these polyfills are no longer needed. The corresponding functionality is now handled by Mountain's native Rust implementations or Tauri APIs. This cleanup completes the migration started in the previous commit which redirected Output imports to Configuration/Polyfill.",
